Document Image Collection and Use

Our app captures images of identity documents when you use Camera or Gallery. This data is used only to run on-device OCR / MRZ / barcode recognition and to show the result on your phone.

We use this data solely to provide document recognition. We do not send document images to FacePlugin cloud, and we do not share them with third parties.

Document images are not stored by the app after you leave the result screen. Frames exist in memory only for the duration of capture and recognition.

We take the security and privacy of your data seriously and use industry-standard measures to protect it from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.
